# Changelog

All notable changes to this project will be documented in this file.

## [1.3.0] - 2026-05-19

### Changed

* Running `python app.py` now starts only the server

### Fixed

* Improved logo/icon sizing and scaling

## [1.2.0] - 2026-05-19

### Added

* Cross-platform support for Windows, Linux, and macOS
* Updated application logo and branding

## [1.1.0] - 2026-05-13

### Added

* Queue reordering via drag & drop

### Fixed

* Fixed a UI/playback bug caused by special characters in certain track titles
